      "status": "done",
      "text": "**Requirement.** Computed from records when the brief is built: an open internal next action (a handoff task a person wrote or accepted) or an open opportunity's next action past its due time; the latest customer reply on a record with no approved outbound message, captured sent message, logged call or meeting, or completed action on that record since, once the awaiting-response interval (TEAM-003, working days in the workspace timezone) has passed; a meeting completed within the last 120 days with no note, logged call or meeting, completed action, handoff, draft, approved message or captured sent message on its records after it; and a draft on an open opportunity left untouched longer than the workspace stale interval, with no outbound attempt and no customer stop event. A recommendation carries no due time and is never a promise by itself. **Acceptance.** 1. Advance past each task/reply/meeting/draft deadline, complete the corresponding obligation and verify overdue lines appear and clear from actual records.",
      "title": "Overdue promises"
    }
